      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is one of three opening prayers offered by the guest chaplain, Rabbi Dr. Isaac Mayer Wise, for the week commencing 11 April 1853. The prayer was published in “The Israelite Chaplain in the N.Y. Legislature,” <tei:hi rend="italic">The Asmonean</tei:hi> (15 April 1853), p. 5. It is the only prayer we have from this week that he officiated in 1853.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
